WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.887
Commissioner Giuliano Zaccardelli, 2000 to 2006.

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:14.200
His tenure is defined by the Maher Arar case — an innocent Canadian citizen deported to Syria and tortured based on RCMP intelligence sharing.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.450
Zaccardelli resigned after contradicting his own testimony before Parliament.
